WEBVTT

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:11.490
Onii-chan, can you tell me 
what a "panchira" is?

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:14.850
A p-panchira?!

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:51.000
A fanservice scene and a new heroine?

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:51.750
Yes.

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:53.620
I got an e-mail from Shinozaki-san

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:56.840
Episode 3: My Little Sister and I are Light Novel Authors Together

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:55.800
saying I should enhance
 the fanservice scenes

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:59.460
and introduce a heroine 
who isn't a little sister.

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:02.420
Shinozaki-san gave you actual advice?

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:05.020
But a new heroine, huh?

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:08.910
She also suggested I use "panchira"
 in the fanservice scenes.

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:11.970
Right. Panchira. Panchira...

00:02:11.970 --> 00:02:12.770
Pan-chi-ra...

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:15.780
Onii-chan, what exactly <i>is</i> a "panchira"?

00:02:16.430 --> 00:02:18.070
A-Are you seriously asking me that?!

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:20.430
Yes. What is a "panchira"?

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:22.660
I only know that it's deemed to be fanservice.

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:25.800
I-If you really want to know,
 use the internet...

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:26.960
Why do I have to?

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:29.170
You know what it is, don't you, Onii-chan?

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:31.150
Please tell me what it is right now!

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:32.670
R-Right now?!

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:33.920
Right now!

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:35.170
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:37.490
All right.

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:40.530
But I'm only doing this to help you 
learn about light novels, okay?

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:42.040
Yes, of course.

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:45.100
Listen, Suzuka. A panchira is...

00:02:45.280 --> 00:02:46.770
Y-Yes?!

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:50.140
A panchira is...

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:53.650
...the t-term for when you catch 
a peek at a girl's panties.

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:58.450
<i>Wh-What am I saying to my little sister?!</i>

00:02:58.450 --> 00:03:00.140
O-Onii-chan...

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.690
Is this some kind of bad joke?

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:06.740
No! It really <i>does</i> mean that, honest!

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:08.300
I don't understand.

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:11.420
Why is it considered fanservice 
to see someone's panties?

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:14.030
Because seeing them makes people happy!

00:03:14.030 --> 00:03:14.750
Huh?!

00:03:15.190 --> 00:03:18.090
The core readership of light 
novels is men around my age,

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:21.260
so they enjoy scenes that show panties.

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:23.760
S-Seeing panties makes them happy?

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:26.320
Yes, it makes them very happy!

00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:29.120
Does seeing a girl's panties
 make you happy, too, Onii-chan?

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:31.060
Well, I don't <i>hate</i> them, naturally—

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:34.800
Wait, wh-what are you even asking, Suzuka?!

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:34.800
I see. So they make you happy, huh?

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:38.720
That explains why there are so many scenes 
like that in the books you read, too.

00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:40.140
Suzuka-san?!

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:41.780
Huh?

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:44.450
Seeing panties makes Onii-chan happy...

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:45.920
Suzuka-san?!

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:48.120
But showing him my panties...

00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:50.500
No, even so...

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:53.490
Hey! Listen when I'm talking to you!

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:00.520
What do you think you're doing?!

00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:04.050
If I lift up my skirt, 
that's a "panchira," right?

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:05.430
No, it's not!

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:06.890
Stop joking around!

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:08.790
I'm not joking.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:12.070
I'm trying to make my 
series more entertaining.

00:04:12.070 --> 00:04:13.890
I'll do anything to make that happen.

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:14.900
Huh?!

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:18.260
You're the only person I can 
rely on for this, Onii-chan!

00:04:18.260 --> 00:04:21.050
A-All right, all right. 
If you insist, I'll help you.

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:24.410
Thank you so much, Onii-chan!

00:04:25.940 --> 00:04:29.410
So what do you want to 
know about panchira?

00:04:29.820 --> 00:04:34.020
Okay, basically, I want to know in 
what kind of situations you'd see one.

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:35.190
Makes sense.

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:38.700
The most important thing about 
a panchira is that it has to seem natural.

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:40.950
Suzuka, try drawing your 
knees up to your chest.

00:04:40.950 --> 00:04:41.920
Okay.

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:44.360
Like this?

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:48.280
I see.

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:50.930
You're right. Sitting like 
this exposes my panties.

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:53.320
You're... remarkably calm.

00:04:53.320 --> 00:04:55.360
What's the matter, Onii-chan?

00:04:55.360 --> 00:04:57.170
Why are you averting your eyes?

00:04:57.170 --> 00:05:00.070
Uh, w-well, I may be helping you,

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:02.400
but it's not polite to stare, right?

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:07.110
But it's not a panchira if someone 
isn't <i>peeking</i> at them, right?

00:05:07.560 --> 00:05:09.280
That's true, but...

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:11.640
So I'm counting on you, Onii-chan!

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:16.690
Yes, okay, that's enough!

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:19.140
You understand what 
a panchira is now, don't you?!

00:05:19.140 --> 00:05:20.190
I suppose so.

00:05:20.190 --> 00:05:23.710
It's not something I could ever have 
understood without experiencing it.

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:25.880
I-I'm glad you get it now.

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:27.990
Also, seeing your reaction,

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:31.300
I now get why panchira 
are considered fanservice.

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:38.150
Well, let's talk about this new heroine next.

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:41.420
Do you think it needs one, too, Onii-chan?

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:44.940
Well, it <i>is</i> a romantic comedy, 
so another girl won't hurt, will it?

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:47.910
I see.

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:50.490
Stupid Onii-chan.

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:52.420
"Stupid"?!

00:05:53.210 --> 00:05:55.080
That puts me in a bind.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:55.620
Huh?

00:05:56.050 --> 00:06:00.460
I don't have a single idea 
for a new character.

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:02.910
In that case, leave it to me!

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:03.500
Huh?

00:06:04.180 --> 00:06:07.380
I've read a heap of light novels, after all!

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:09.080
Onii-chan!

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:12.000
For starters, heroines 
are all about balance.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:14.680
So identify the moe elements 
you're lacking right now,

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:16.740
and your character should form naturally...

00:06:18.130 --> 00:06:19.350
Onii-chan?

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:21.860
I can't think of anything.

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:23.100
Onii-chan.

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:26.410
Don't tell me you're drawing a blank, too...

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:31.420
Huh? Oh, I know! At times like these, 
it's best to get the opinions of others!

00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:32.120
Huh?!

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:36.520
You called me here because you want <i>me</i> 
to give you ideas for volume two?!

00:06:36.520 --> 00:06:38.120
What cruel game is this?!

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:42.500
Your drive to improve 
keeps surprising me, Sensei.

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.080
Hey, Yuu!

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:45.120
Y-Yes?

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:47.620
Who <i>is</i> this blonde bombshell?!

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:53.640
Oh, this is Double Peace-sensei, 
the illustrator for my series.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:54.510
Huh?!

00:06:54.940 --> 00:06:58.120
And this is my classmate and 
professional light novel writer,

00:06:58.120 --> 00:06:59.390
Himuro Mai-sensei.

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:00.940
Nice to meet you!

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:01.920
Oh, hello.

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:06.040
And Sensei, my pen-name 
is Ahegao Double Peace.

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:08.070
The "Ahegao" is the most important part,

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:10.230
so please use my full name.

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:14.280
A new heroine?

00:07:14.590 --> 00:07:15.880
That's right.

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:18.910
I can't quite figure out what 
kind of heroine to create.

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:21.040
I understand.

00:07:21.280 --> 00:07:25.160
So before giving you my opinion, 
what role will this heroine play?

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:28.720
R-Role? Uh, her role...

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:31.350
She doesn't really have a role.

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:35.830
The general framework of the story 
is already set without her in it.

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:38.310
That's what you told me, wasn't it, Onii-chan?

00:07:38.540 --> 00:07:41.000
Oh, y-yeah! That's right.

00:07:42.030 --> 00:07:43.150
What?

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:44.450
If you're calling her a heroine,

00:07:44.450 --> 00:07:47.250
she must have an important 
role to play, you know.

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:48.570
An important role?

00:07:48.740 --> 00:07:49.860
You astound me.

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:52.840
How can you write light 
novels without knowing that?

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:57.090
Listen, a heroine is someone who can 
become the <i>protagonist's</i> heroine.

00:07:57.090 --> 00:08:01.580
It means there's the underlying possibility 
that the main character <i>could</i> fall for her.

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:03.360
I-I see.

00:08:03.360 --> 00:08:06.360
Naturally, the readers are on her side, too,

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:09.380
so as an author, you have to bear
that in mind while you're writing.

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:12.090
So what should I do for this character?

00:08:12.520 --> 00:08:16.200
<i>Towano Chikai is asking </i>me<i> for guidance?!</i>

00:08:16.610 --> 00:08:18.170
You're being pathetic.

00:08:18.170 --> 00:08:23.810
But since I'm your number 
one fan, I'll tell you. You...

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:27.780
Sensei, you should just write 
a character that you find cute.

00:08:27.780 --> 00:08:30.280
That's what I was about to say!

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:34.780
Now, it's time for you to start talking 
about what kind of heroines you like!

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:37.740
Wait, you're just using this 
as an excuse to interview me!

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:39.720
N-No, I'm not!

00:08:39.720 --> 00:08:41.940
I don't think this is the perfect chance

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:44.920
to find out <i>exactly</i> what your type is at all!

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:48.540
Sensei's fetishes, huh?

00:08:48.760 --> 00:08:50.530
Hey, now...

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:54.200
I figured this might happen, so it's 
a good thing I brought these with me.

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:56.050
Excuse me, little sister...

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:57.430
Y-Yes?

00:08:57.690 --> 00:09:00.310
May I use your bathroom?

00:09:02.840 --> 00:09:04.600
Sorry for making you wait!

00:09:05.010 --> 00:09:08.360
Sensei, you like costumes 
like this one, don't you?

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:11.330
H-Hey! What on earth are you wearing?!

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:11.330
Why are you s-s-staring at her like that?!

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:12.360
Huh? No, uh...

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:14.740
I'm a bunny girl!

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:16.610
Well, duh! I can see that!

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:20.120
I'm experimenting to find out 
which archetypes do it for Sensei.

00:09:20.360 --> 00:09:24.580
You can figure out his preferences 
by studying his reactions.

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:28.290
You're right. It's clear to see that 
Yuu has a thing for bunny girls.

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:31.800
Hold up, hold up! Don't go
deciding what I like on your own!

00:09:32.140 --> 00:09:36.300
But we get a clearer picture if 
we see your reactions for ourselves.

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:39.190
Oh, there's no need to worry.

00:09:39.190 --> 00:09:43.930
As your number one partner, 
I'll do an excellent job handling this task!

00:09:44.370 --> 00:09:46.110
Wh-What are you saying?!

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:49.440
As his number one fan, I'm taking part, too!

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:54.280
H-H-Hey! What are you doing?!

00:09:52.160 --> 00:09:54.280
I brought lots of costumes!

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:55.600
Don't look!

00:09:55.600 --> 00:09:58.200
Himuro-san, please don't change in here!

00:09:58.650 --> 00:10:02.310
My room's right next door, 
so please get changed in there!

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:03.700
O-Okay!

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:12.710
H-Hey, that's...

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:13.840
Wh-What?

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:15.650
It's not like this is embarrassing.

00:10:15.650 --> 00:10:18.220
G-Go ahead and let your eyes drink me in!

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:20.300
What an outfit...

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:22.440
You like stuff like this, don't you?

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:25.470
I saw the huge collection of fantasy 
novels on your bookshelves.

00:10:25.710 --> 00:10:28.490
You even made a mental note of that?!

00:10:28.490 --> 00:10:32.480
I memorized every detail of your 
room last time I was here.

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:36.140
Oh, I didn't realize your 
hooters were so big, Mai.

00:10:36.140 --> 00:10:38.340
Sensei can't take his eyes off them!

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:42.010
Wh-Where do you think 
you're looking, you brute?!

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:42.010
"C-Can't take my eyes off them"?!

00:10:42.010 --> 00:10:42.700
Ow!

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:44.660
What are you doing?!

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:47.480
Here, Sensei. Boobs.

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:49.370
I'm glad your fans are 
so <i>passionate</i>, Onii-chan.

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:49.920
Hey, stop that!

00:10:50.150 --> 00:10:52.420
M-My fans?

00:10:53.050 --> 00:10:54.170
Here!

00:10:56.480 --> 00:10:57.550
Ni hao!

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:02.260
H-How many outfits do you own?

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:06.080
A lot of these are from my company.

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:07.640
You're unbelievable.

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:09.450
Seriously.

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:12.000
H-Huh? Where's Suzuka?

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.330
Onii-chan...

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:22.320
S-Suzuka-san, why are you 
wearing that outfit?!

00:11:22.610 --> 00:11:24.880
Oh, the little sister joins the fray!

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:26.730
A powerful rival appears!

00:11:26.730 --> 00:11:28.580
I-I, um...

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:31.320
I didn't want you two to be the only ones

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:34.300
bearing the burden of helping 
Onii-chan with his research.

00:11:34.300 --> 00:11:36.590
Th-This is my duty as his little sister!

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:41.440
And you're also wearing an unrealistic
 combo of bloomers and knee-high socks.

00:11:41.440 --> 00:11:43.520
What fantastic fashion sense!

00:11:43.520 --> 00:11:46.950
O-Onii-chan, why aren't you saying anything?

00:11:46.950 --> 00:11:47.600
Huh?

00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:51.400
Why are you fascinated with <i>her</i>?!

00:11:51.400 --> 00:11:54.120
I-I'm not fascinated at all.

00:11:52.030 --> 00:11:54.120
Looks like this contest is settled.

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:54.860
Huh?

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:58.870
The gaze he fixed on his little sister 
was the most passionate of all!

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:02.110
I wouldn't gaze passionately 
at my little sister!

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:04.840
This is humiliating, but it's valuable data.

00:12:04.840 --> 00:12:07.210
Yuu goes for bloomers and knee-high socks.

00:12:07.210 --> 00:12:09.370
Don't just decide that on your own!

00:12:07.210 --> 00:12:09.370
Well, that's all settled now.

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:12.520
In the end, his little sister 
is the strongest one here.

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:14.970
We've been thoroughly trounced!

00:12:17.050 --> 00:12:18.890
Sensei, I'll see you later.

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:20.880
Make sure you work hard, at least.

00:12:22.240 --> 00:12:23.000
"Later"?

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:25.960
Did you find today's "research" useful, Suzuka?

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:28.310
Yes, it was very helpful.

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:30.140
That's good.

00:12:30.320 --> 00:12:32.560
I'm going to start writing at once,

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:34.110
so please excuse me.

00:12:35.180 --> 00:12:36.410
S-Suzuka?!

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:40.930
I should work on my own manuscript.

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:47.990
<b>My Sister, 
My Writer

00:12:57.320 --> 00:13:00.220
I guess it's been several days 
since we did that "research."

00:13:00.220 --> 00:13:02.230
I haven't made any progress.

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:06.720
Shinozaki-san?

00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:08.590
<i>Hello?</i>

00:13:08.590 --> 00:13:10.010
Towano-sensei?

00:13:10.710 --> 00:13:12.600
<i>What do you need today?</i>

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:13.930
<i>I'm bit busy right now,</i>

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:15.270
<i>so if you wanna chat, can we—</i>

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:16.880
What are you talking about?

00:13:16.880 --> 00:13:17.600
<i>Huh?</i>

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:21.950
<i>Your deadline passed and you 
haven't sent me the manuscript yet.</i>

00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:23.110
Deadline?

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:27.650
I haven't heard from you 
since you sent me that e-mail

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:29.440
saying you'd rewrite it 
to add in a new heroine.

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:31.560
<i>U-Uh, what do you mean?</i>

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:33.620
That's my line!

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:37.570
<i>It sounds like you haven't come 
down with something, at least.</i>

00:13:37.570 --> 00:13:40.000
<i>Anyway, send me the manuscript!</i>

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:42.280
I-I'm sorry! I'll call you back later!

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:44.300
<i>Hey, did you hear what I said?!</i>

00:13:45.390 --> 00:13:47.430
Hey, are you in there, Suzuka?

00:13:48.490 --> 00:13:49.330
Suzuka!

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:51.920
I'm coming in.

00:13:57.160 --> 00:13:58.720
<i>She fell asleep at her desk?</i>

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:04.220
<i>This is the manuscript for volume two?</i>

00:14:05.800 --> 00:14:06.990
<i>No, I can't!</i>

00:14:08.220 --> 00:14:09.300
<i>Sh-Shoot!</i>

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:13.830
Wh-What's this?

00:14:14.560 --> 00:14:15.830
The new heroine...

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:19.120
She's a beautiful blonde 
transfer student in his class

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:21.670
who also stalks him, and 
everything she says is dirty.

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:25.790
She's just there to make otaku 
culture references and flash her panties...

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:28.860
This isn't entertaining at all.

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:31.320
Did Suzuka really write this?

00:14:33.400 --> 00:14:36.400
Oh, um, I...

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:36.400
Huh? Onii-chan, what are you doing there?

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:38.100
Oh, that's my...

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:41.120
I-I didn't do it on purpose.

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:42.650
I just happened to see it...

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:44.550
Wh-What's that?

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:45.780
S-Sorry!

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:48.870
A-Anyway, why are you even in my room?

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:51.640
Oh, right! I came in here to fetch you.

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:52.280
Huh?

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:55.020
I just got a call from Shinozaki-san.

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:57.540
She said you hadn't turned 
in your manuscript.

00:14:57.540 --> 00:14:59.250
Oh, that's right.

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:02.980
I was trying to hit my 
deadline and kept writing...

00:15:02.980 --> 00:15:05.960
Are you having trouble with volume two?

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:08.980
Wh-What are you talking about?!

00:15:08.980 --> 00:15:10.320
I wasn't born yesterday.

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:13.920
That's the only reason someone 
as diligent as you would miss a deadline.

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:17.770
You're right.

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:18.860
Suzuka...

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:20.570
I'm having trouble writing it.

00:15:20.570 --> 00:15:24.220
No, maybe it's more accurate 
to say I don't <i>want</i> to write it.

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:27.230
You're trying to write something 
you don't want to write?

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:28.080
Well...

00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:32.980
Even you said I should introduce 
a new heroine, didn't you?

00:15:32.980 --> 00:15:34.390
S-Sure, but...

00:15:34.390 --> 00:15:38.450
I want to write something people 
will find even more entertaining.

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:40.330
I'll do anything to make that happen.

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:44.580
That doesn't mean you should write 
something you don't want to write.

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:46.810
You look like you're in a lot of pain!

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:49.970
My own suffering is inconsequential.

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:51.590
Like hell it is!

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:55.000
You look like you're having dizzy spells.

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:56.920
You've been missing sleep, haven't you?

00:15:57.630 --> 00:16:01.430
Jeez, you need to calm down 
and get some rest first.

00:16:01.430 --> 00:16:04.850
Sure, your manuscript matters, but nothing's 
more important than your health, you hear?

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:08.300
I-I appreciate your concern,

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:13.280
but writing something people 
will find entertaining is <i>vital</i> to me.

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:14.910
Why?!

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:17.240
Why are you being so stubborn about this?

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:20.910
Your work was already entertaining 
enough in volume one!

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:23.430
Please don't say things 
you don't really mean!

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:27.290
You don't think that at all, Onii-chan!

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:31.440
Huh? I think your work is 
<i>incredibly</i> entertaining.

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:32.600
Liar!

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:36.010
When I asked you what 
you thought of my work,

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:39.510
you only said it was "okay," remember?!

00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:42.240
W-Wait!

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:43.770
You've got the wrong end of the stick!

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:47.430
And how exactly can the phrase, 
"it's okay" be misunderstood?

00:16:47.430 --> 00:16:51.270
I-It slipped out because I was jealous.

00:16:51.270 --> 00:16:53.610
You don't need to console me!

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:56.400
No, it's the honest-to-goodness truth!

00:16:56.400 --> 00:17:02.080
Then, let me ask you this, Onii-chan: 
What was it about my work that you enjoyed?!

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:04.570
I enjoyed...

00:17:05.020 --> 00:17:06.880
You can't answer that, can you?

00:17:07.340 --> 00:17:09.680
You're always like this, Onii-chan.

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:11.660
You're kind to a fault,

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:15.130
and you worry about others without 
thinking of yourself at all.

00:17:18.380 --> 00:17:21.490
I'm sorry, but please give me some space.

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:31.530
Dammit.

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:33.110
I..

00:17:33.540 --> 00:17:35.990
<i>Onii-chan, I hate you!</i>

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:41.270
<i>I haven't grown up at all since then.</i>

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:44.290
<i>Am I doomed to be powerless
 to help Suzuka again?</i>

00:17:45.280 --> 00:17:46.500
This is no joke.

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:48.980
<i>If I couldn't do it before...</i>

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:51.060
<i>All the more reason to do it this time.</i>

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.810
<i>I'm her stand-in now.</i>

00:17:53.810 --> 00:17:56.050
<i>Together, we make one light novel author.</i>

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:59.720
<i>No, before any of that, 
I was always her older brother first!</i>

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:05.080
<i>There's only one thing I need to think about.</i>

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:07.340
<i>What's so entertaining about Suzuka's work?</i>

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:11.490
<i>Frankly, her novel is a real page-turner.</i>

00:18:11.920 --> 00:18:14.980
<i>But I can't put into words 
what makes it so entertaining.</i>

00:18:15.680 --> 00:18:17.720
<i>There's the little sister 
with her earnest passes,</i>

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:21.380
<i>and the older brother who cares 
for her and hesitantly acquiesces.</i>

00:18:25.990 --> 00:18:29.750
The truth is, I love you, Onii-chan.

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:37.510
<i>What I want to read isn't some story about 
a new heroine Suzuka's struggling to write.</i>

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:39.850
I've got it.

00:18:41.080 --> 00:18:42.150
I know now.

00:18:42.150 --> 00:18:44.570
Wh-Why are you bursting in like that?

00:18:44.570 --> 00:18:45.980
Just listen to me!

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:49.540
You don't need to write something 
you don't want to write.

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:50.520
Huh?!

00:18:50.840 --> 00:18:54.100
I-I don't understand! What are you saying?

00:18:54.680 --> 00:18:59.280
Listen. I know why your 
work is so entertaining.

00:18:59.280 --> 00:19:01.280
And why is that, huh?!

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:04.780
Because it's a flirty 
brother-sister romantic comedy!

00:19:05.650 --> 00:19:07.540
"F-Flirty"?!

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:10.630
I love the scenes where 
the two siblings flirt,

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:12.330
and they're what make it so entertaining.

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:16.750
I read it dozens of times because I wanted 
to see the little sister act all dere-dere!

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:19.600
So please write volume two in the same vein!

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:22.760
If she's just gonna get in the way, 
then it doesn't need a new heroine!

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:25.390
That little sister is all the heroine I need!

00:19:25.800 --> 00:19:29.270
I... I love that little sister!

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:37.030
W-Wait, hold on!

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:43.280
The little sister I love is the one 
you wrote. I don't mean you, Suzuka.

00:19:38.880 --> 00:19:43.280
O-Onii-chan loves... No way, 
it can't... It can't be happening!

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:45.720
I didn't mean to phrase it 
in a misleading way,

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:49.250
but there's no doubt about it! 
The reason I love your work is because...

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:50.220
"Love"?!

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:51.480
Y-You're joking, right?

00:19:51.480 --> 00:19:55.250
Onii-chan, you're just saying 
that to spare my feelings!

00:19:55.250 --> 00:20:00.220
You can tell if I'm lying or not 
by looking into my eyes!

00:20:00.770 --> 00:20:03.390
<i>Onii-chan's so close to me...</i>

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:06.220
Y-You're not lying...

00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:09.470
I'm glad you understand.

00:20:09.780 --> 00:20:12.200
<i>Why am I so happy?</i>

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:17.010
<i>Onii-chan wants me more 
than some new heroine!</i>

00:20:18.250 --> 00:20:20.180
U-Um, Suzuka?

00:20:21.050 --> 00:20:23.020
I'll rewrite it tonight.

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:23.740
Huh?!

00:20:24.230 --> 00:20:27.290
Could you stay by my side 
while I write it, Onii-chan?

00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:29.740
S-Sure. Wait, today?

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:33.400
You can't write a whole 
volume in a single night!

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:34.850
Don't worry.

00:20:34.850 --> 00:20:38.500
I've just been possessed by 
the greatest spirit of them all!

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:39.260
Huh?!

00:20:39.260 --> 00:20:44.010
Onii-chan loves his little sister!

00:20:42.150 --> 00:20:47.760
N-No! It just happens that the 
<i>character</i> I like is a little sister!

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:47.760
Onii-chan loves his little sister!

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:57.730
Onii-chan loves me!

00:20:58.240 --> 00:21:01.060
O-Onii-chan, you can go to sleep if you want.

00:21:01.060 --> 00:21:03.880
No. You're tired, too, right?

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:07.870
I'm fine as long as you're here with me.

00:21:08.220 --> 00:21:10.120
But that means I can't...

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:13.530
Well, in that case, talk to me about the past.

00:21:14.240 --> 00:21:15.370
The past?

00:21:15.720 --> 00:21:18.380
Yes, the past.

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:23.700
<i>Hey, Suzuka...</i>

00:21:24.560 --> 00:21:28.240
<i>Do you think I'm more 
reliable as a brother now?</i>

00:21:33.720 --> 00:21:35.390
All done!

00:21:36.900 --> 00:21:39.040
He looks way too cute when he's sleeping!

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:47.190
There's no way I can let another 
woman see him so vulnerable.

00:21:47.190 --> 00:21:49.370
Onii-chan's already 
popular with the ladies.

00:21:51.640 --> 00:21:55.200
Onii-chan, you're my brother.

00:21:55.200 --> 00:21:57.080
And don't you forget it,

00:21:58.620 --> 00:21:59.930
H-Here I go!

00:21:59.930 --> 00:22:01.240
Forgive me.

00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:13.170
I love you, Onii-chan.

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:51.320
<b>Nagami Yuu 
Research 
Notebook</b>

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:59.950
<b>Little Sister
 Love!?</b>

00:23:44.980 --> 00:24:00.000
Illustration: Nakata Yumi
Coloring: Maroppe

00:23:45.590 --> 00:23:47.260
Yes, hello! Esaka-san here!

00:23:47.260 --> 00:23:49.740
Today, we're with failed light 
novel author, Himuro Mai-chan!

00:23:49.740 --> 00:23:50.590
You're so rude.

00:23:50.590 --> 00:23:51.850
I'm going home!

00:23:51.850 --> 00:23:53.100
Well, stop me from leaving, then!

00:23:53.100 --> 00:23:54.840
Why? You can go if you want.

00:23:54.070 --> 00:24:00.000
Next Episode

00:23:54.070 --> 00:24:00.000
I Just Wanted to Catch Up to My Little Sister, That's All

00:23:54.840 --> 00:23:56.000
We're outta time! See you next time!

00:23:56.000 --> 00:23:57.160
Huh? No way!

00:23:57.160 --> 00:23:58.910
There was stuff I wanted to talk about!

00:23:58.910 --> 00:24:00.000
We can still—
